  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Infrastructure and Finance Compact - Financial Markets Development Project (FMDP): The FMDP will work with lenders and the private sector to leverage grant financing and form new partnerships that unlock existing money to fund lower-risk, high-quality infrastructure projects. These investments aim to increase the participation of private or commercially oriented infrastructure investments, especially Indonesian lenders, making markets more competitive and accelerating economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
